{"title":"Ashsworn Flamekeeper","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\"><p class=\"wp-lede\">A level 60 Ashsworn that attacks with burn (ranged).</p>\n      <h2>Fighting it</h2><div class=\"s\"><i>Weak</i> <span class=\"tag-chip weak\">freeze</span></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">A weakness adds 15% damage (the game's own rule). Monsters have no resistances.</p>\n      <p class=\"s good\">⭐ Seen as an elite 1 times (3.7% of sightings). Elites have 3× HP, hit 1.4× harder, give 3× XP and 2.5× loot.</p>\n      \n      <h2>Levels</h2><div class=\"q-picker\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Level\"><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/ashsworn-flamekeeper\">All levels</a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/ashsworn-flamekeeper?lv=59\">Lv 59 <span>1</span></a><a class=\"q-chip on\" href=\"#/monster/ashsworn-flamekeeper?lv=60\">Lv 60 <span>91</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/ashsworn-flamekeeper?lv=61\">Lv 61 <span>82</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/ashsworn-flamekeeper?lv=62\">Lv 62 <span>35</span></a></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">The same monster spawns at different levels, and its hitpoints, damage and XP follow its level (the game’s own formula). In the game a monster more than 5 levels above you shows its level as “???”.</p>\n      <div class=\"g-scroll\"><table class=\"g-table q-table\"><thead><tr><th>Level</th><th>HP</th><th>Damage</th><th>XP</th><th>Elite (HP · dmg · XP)</th><th>Seen</th><th>Mostly</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/ashsworn-flamekeeper?lv=59\" title=\"Pick level 59\"><td><b>59</b></td><td>440</td><td>37</td><td>2,950</td><td class=\"muted\">1,320 · 51.8 · 8,850</td><td>1</td><td>in the wilds around 200, -1064</td></tr><tr class=\"q-row-on\" data-href=\"#/monster/ashsworn-flamekeeper\" title=\"Show all levels\"><td><b>60</b> <span class=\"muted\">(base)</span></td><td>455</td><td>37.5</td><td>3,000</td><td class=\"muted\">1,365 · 52.5 · 9,000</td><td>91</td><td>in the wilds around 277, -1115</td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/ashsworn-flamekeeper?lv=61\" title=\"Pick level 61\"><td><b>61</b></td><td>462</td><td>38.1</td><td>3,050</td><td class=\"muted\">1,386 · 53.3 · 9,150</td><td>82</td><td>in the wilds around 275, -1171</td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/ashsworn-flamekeeper?lv=62\" title=\"Pick level 62\"><td><b>62</b></td><td>469</td><td>38.6</td><td>3,100</td><td class=\"muted\">1,407 · 54 · 9,300</td><td>35</td><td>in the wilds around 283, -1188</td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n      <button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"monster\" data-map-id=\"ashsworn-flamekeeper\" data-map-level=\"60\">Show level 60 on the map</button>\n      \n      \n      <h2>Drops</h2><div class=\"collector-extra collector-monster-drops\"><b>Observed drops</b><div class=\"muted\">No kills of this monster reported yet; 4 looted corpses recorded.</div><div style=\"margin-top:8px\"><b>Normal loot</b><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"gold-coin\" title=\"Gold Coin - 10 recorded drops, 1,618 total, 50–504 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/2216cc0344c9d30bb3ee.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Gold Coin</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/1<br>×50–504</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"titanium-kryss\" title=\"Titanium Kryss - in 1 of 4 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 1 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/59f833ee7c52ee8c1c91.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Titanium Kryss</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/4<br>×1</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"titanium-dagger\" title=\"Titanium Dagger - in 1 of 4 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 1 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/76a2e17f4e9945d67b1f.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Titanium Dagger</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/4<br>×1</span><span class=\"entity-chip-quality\">Excellent: 1 of 1</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"banked-ember\" title=\"Banked Ember - in 1 of 4 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 1 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/gen/676a046c065d71a85ae7.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Banked Ember</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/4<br>×1</span></div></div></div><div style=\"margin-top:8px\"><b>⭐ Elite loot</b><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link elite\" data-item=\"ash-charm\" title=\"Ash Charm - in 1 of 4 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 1 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/gen/f82a451885528bc6a9e6.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Ash Charm</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/4<br>×1</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link elite\" data-item=\"scroll-fireball\" title=\"Scroll Fireball - in 1 of 4 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 1 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/6b66cd8cfb8dcdd17e1d.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Scroll Fireball</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/4<br>×1</span></div></div></div><div class=\"muted\" style=\"margin-top:8px\">Drop rate as 1/X (about 1 kill in X drops it, counted over the corpses whose loot was recorded; kills nobody looted are not counted), and ×N, how many come in one drop.</div></div>\n      <h2>Inside dungeons and buildings</h2><ul class=\"wp-list\"><li><b>The Ash Temple</b> <span class=\"muted\">· 12</span> <button type=\"button\" class=\"open-zone\" data-zone=\"-443\">Layout</button></li><li><b>The Molten Heart</b> <span class=\"muted\">· 7</span> <button type=\"button\" class=\"open-zone\" data-zone=\"6304\">Layout</button></li></ul>\n      <h2>Where to find it</h2><figure class=\"wp-inset\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><div class=\"wp-inset-map\" style=\"transform:translate(-995.5px,305.4px)\"><img src=\"wtiles/3/